        "Scrub the Leg Barrier Basics: The Standard Leg Cross and the Meaning of Crossed Legs",
        "Your mission is to scrub through the foundations of leg barriers: why crossed legs shield the genital area just as crossed arms defend the heart and upper body, why crossed arms signal a more negative attitude than crossed legs, and why women must be read with care because they were taught to sit like a lady. Then weigh the standard leg cross: its nervous, reserved or defensive meaning, when it is only a supportive gesture, how it reads during lectures and in cold weather, and why a sales person who asks for a decision from a buyer in the crossed arms and crossed legs pose is very foolish.",
